{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pitchThreshold","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deliberately far below the yaw gate: Vision’s pitch estimate from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"rectangles request COMPRESSES the physical angle massively. On-device","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(2026-06-11, iPhone front camera): a full, neck-straining chin-down"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"hold reads only ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"+6°","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", so the previous ±10° bar was physically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unreachable and both pitch poses stalled the enrolment walk forever.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"±5° cleared that full-tilt reading but only by ~1°, so with Vision’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pitch noise the hold rarely accumulated — the pitch poses still felt","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“too high”. Lowered to ±4° (2026-06-18) for ~2° of headroom below the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"6° saturated reading, so most frames at a real tilt clear the gate.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/posetarget\/pitchthreshold"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Property","externalID":"s:5YEOFR10PoseTargetO14pitchThresholdSdvpZ","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":"